--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57bb45da4a607714eaa4a36844303d5d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeCardDefinition
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrativeCardDefinition
  narrativeCards:
  - messageContent: At first, it was just a few little things here and there...
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 0
    cardDuration: 5
  - messageContent: Partially consumed cracker rolls, a few misplaced fruit, and
      a deli container of thinly sliced black forest ham that'd inexplicably diminished
      in weight as the days passed by.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 1
    cardDuration: 7.5
  - messageContent: For quite some time now, I'd noticed that my food had been disappearing.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 2
    cardDuration: 5
  - messageContent: On most days, I would simply attribute it to any reasonable explanation
      that came to mind.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 3
    cardDuration: 7.5
  - messageContent: '"Your wallet was a little light, remember? You must''ve put
      that back on the shelf."'
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 4
    cardDuration: 5
  - messageContent: '"You might''ve left that on your desk at work, I''ll grab it
      tomorrow morning."'
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 5
    cardDuration: 5
  - messageContent: At times, the losses were so severe that there was no rational
      explanation that could account for my dwindling food supplies.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 6
    cardDuration: 7.5
  - messageContent: Perhaps I would have considered it just another one of life's
      many valuable lessons. No use crying over spilt milk as it were.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 7
    cardDuration: 7.5
  - messageContent: However, as the rumbling in my stomach intensified and my wallet
      began to feel as light as a drifting leaf, I realized I had no option but to
      dig deeper into the mystery before me.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 8
    cardDuration: 10
